#: build-src/install/config.md:1
msgid "NumaHOP Configuration."
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/config.md:3
msgid ""
"NumaHOP is configured in yaml files called `application.yml` or `application-"
"<profile>.yml`."
msgstr ""
"La configuration de NumaHOP se fait dans des fichiers yaml nomes `application.yml`"
"ou `application-<profile>.yml`."

#: build-src/install/config.md:6
msgid "When NumaHOP is started it search and load configs in this order:"
msgstr "Quand NumaHOP demare il cherce and charge les fichiers de configuration dans cet ordre:"

#: build-src/install/config.md:7
msgid "Inside the packaged war/jar ressources."
msgstr "Dans les ressources a l'interieur du packet jar."

#: build-src/install/config.md:8
msgid "In the folder `./config`(relative to its current directory)."
msgstr "Dans le dossier `./config` (relatif a son repertoir d'execution)."

#: build-src/install/config.md:10
msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "Profiles"

#: build-src/install/config.md:12
msgid ""
"There can be multiple files sourced by NumaHOP with a profile system. First "
"the `application.yml` is sourced and then the profiles one. Each load "
"overrides the keys redefined."
msgstr ""
"NumaHOP peut charger plusieurs fichier de configuration a l'aide d'un system de profile."
"En premier il charge le fichier `application.yml` et ensuite les fichiers des profils actifs."
"Chaque chargement écrase les clès de configuration déjà définies."

#: build-src/install/config.md:16
msgid ""
"To activate a profile the flag `--spring.profiles.active` can be passed to "
"the jar:"
msgstr ""
"Pour activer un profile l'argument `--spring.profiles.active` peut être passé"
"au jar:"

#: build-src/install/config.md:22
msgid "The resulting files will be sourced in this order:"
msgstr ""

#: build-src/install/config.md:23
msgid "Inside the jar:"
msgstr "À l'interieur du jar:"

#: build-src/install/config.md:24
msgid "`application.yml`"
msgstr "`application.yml`"

#: build-src/install/config.md:25
msgid "`application-dev.yml`"
msgstr "`application-dev.yml`"

#: build-src/install/config.md:26
msgid "`application-prod.yml`"
msgstr "`application-prod.yml`"

#: build-src/install/config.md:27
msgid "In the working directory:"
msgstr "À l'interieur du répertoir de travail:"

#: build-src/install/config.md:28
msgid "`./config/application.yml`"
msgstr "`./config/application.yml`"

#: build-src/install/config.md:29
msgid "`./config/application-dev.yml`"
msgstr "`./config/application-dev.yml`"

#: build-src/install/config.md:30
msgid "`./config/application-prod.yml`"
msgstr "`./config/application-prod.yml`"

#: build-src/install/config.md:32
msgid "application.yml"
msgstr "application.yml"

#: build-src/install/config.md:34
msgid ""
"Most of the properties in the yaml files are used either by spring-boot or "
"other dependencies but some are custom. All uses of custom properties can be "
"found in the codebase using this command: `grep -e \"@Value\\(\\$\\{.*\\}\\)"
"\"`."
msgstr ""
"La plupart des propriétées disponible dans les fichier de configuration sont"
"définies par SpringBoot certaines le sont par NumaHOP. Toute les utilisation des"
"propriétées de NumaHOP peuvent être trouvées en utilisant la commande: "
"`grep -e \"@Value\\(\\$\\{.*\\}\\)\"`"

#: build-src/install/config.md:38
msgid "Important/UseFull properties to define"
msgstr "Propriétées importantes et utiles"

#: build-src/install/config.md:40
msgid "Instances (Must be set)"
msgstr "Instances (Doit être définie)"

#: build-src/install/config.md:42
msgid ""
"Each establishments using numahop must be declared, choose an id for each "
"libraries using Numahop and sotre it there."
msgstr ""
"Chaque etablissements dans numahop doit etre declare ici. L'id doit correspondre"
"avec l'id de l'etablissement dans la table `library` en base de donnees."

#: build-src/install/config.md:69
msgid "Admin (Must be set)"
msgstr "Admin (Doit être définie)"

#: build-src/install/config.md:70
msgid ""
"The admin is the only account present after the installation. It is very "
"important to define:"
msgstr ""
"Le compte admin est le seul compte present apres installation. "

#: build-src/install/config.md:78
msgid ""
"The password is encrypted using the bcrypt method you can get a good "
"password to encrypt like this:"
msgstr ""
"Le mot de pass est encrypte en utilisant bcrypt. Vous pouvez obtenir un bon"
"mot de passe avec cette commande:"

#: build-src/install/config.md:84
msgid ""
"Then encrypt it with a bcrypt implementation. But pay attention not all "
"bcrypt algorithms are secure. The easiest way to encrypt the password is as "
"such it requires a `python3` installation with the `python3-bcrypt` library:"
msgstr ""
"Ensuit encrypez le avec une implementation de bcrypt. Point d'attention toutes les"
"implémentations de bcrypt ne sont pas sécurisées. Une option est d'encrypter le mot de"
"passe en utilisant `python3` avec le packet `python3-bcrypt`:" 

#: build-src/install/config.md:94
msgid "Where pwd is you password."
msgstr "Ou `pwd` est votre mot de passe."

#: build-src/install/config.md:105
msgid "Jhipster Remember Me key (Must be set)"
msgstr "Jhipster Remember Me key (Doit être définie)"

#: build-src/install/config.md:107
msgid ""
"This is the key needed to make the rememberme service work. It needs to be "
"unique to your installation."
msgstr ""
"C'est la cle qui permet au service rememberme de fonctionner. Elle doit être unique"
"pour votre installation."

#: build-src/install/config.md:115
msgid "Same as the password you can get a good randomized key like this:"
msgstr ""
"De la meme maniere que pour le mot de passe vous pouvez obtenir"
"une bonne clé comme ceci:"

#: build-src/install/config.md:129
msgid "Database and elasticsearch (Must be set)"
msgstr "Base de données et elasticsearch (Doit être définie)"

#: build-src/install/config.md:131
msgid ""
"The information needed by numahop to connect to the database and "
"elasticsearch."
msgstr ""
"Les informations dont NumaHOP a besoin pour se connecter à la base de données et elasticsearch."

#: build-src/install/config.md:146
msgid "Filesystem"
msgstr "Sytème de fichier"

#: build-src/install/config.md:148
msgid ""
"These configuration options define where numahop can find the executables it "
"needs, where to put the various files it generates and where to look for "
"files to import."
msgstr ""
"Ces options de configuration définissent où NumaHOP peut trouver les executables dont "
"il a besoin, ainsi que l'endroit où il doit placer les différent fichiers qu'il génère."

#: build-src/install/config.md:248
msgid "Server"
msgstr "Serveur"

#: build-src/install/config.md:250
msgid "The port used by numahop on the server."
msgstr "Le port utilisé par NumaHOP."

#: build-src/install/config.md:266
msgid "Image Sizes"
msgstr "Tailles d'images"

#: build-src/install/config.md:288
msgid "Cron jobs."
msgstr "Cron jobs"

#: build-src/install/config.md:290
msgid ""
"Some services are annotated with `@Scheduled`. These are cron jobs "
"configured in the cron section:"
msgstr ""
"Plusieurs services de NumaHOP sont annotés avec `@Scheduled`. Ce sont"
"des con jobs configurable."

#: build-src/install/config.md:312
msgid ""
"The value is a [cron expression](https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/"
"reference/integration/scheduling.html#scheduling-cron-expression \"Cron "
"Expression\") used to configure when to run the job."
msgstr ""
"La valeur de chaque clé est une [expression cron](https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/"
"reference/integration/scheduling.html#scheduling-cron-expression \"Cron "
"Expression\") utilisée pour configurer quand la tache doit être executée."

#: build-src/install/config.md:330
msgid "Mail"
msgstr "Mail"
